==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{m|en|ethnic}} + {{m|en|cleansing}}. Perhaps compare {{etyl|sh|en}} {{m|sh|etničko čišćenje}}, though this is probably attested later. Originally used of (and still chiefly associated with) the wars in former Yugoslavia during the 1990s.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# The [[mass]] [[extermination]] or [[expulsion]] of [[people]] belonging to one ethnic or [[religious]] [[group]] by those of another.

